# Animated Grid List — 10 picsum cards that morph between a 2-column grid and a
# full-width list (layout transitions), tilting in 3D while the list scrolls.
# What this test covers: grid -> list toggle via the floating button (quote text
# fades in), scrolling down/up in list mode (rotateX spring follows direction),
# list -> grid while a fling is still moving, scrolling the grid to the end and
# back, rapid repeated toggles interrupting the layout transitions mid-flight.
context platform=ios
open "demos://animations/animated-grid-list"
wait "label=\"Close\"" 45000
# Warm-up touch on the status bar: the first touch of a test can be lost while
# the XCTest runner attaches.
press 330 20
wait 500
wait 1500
# Floating layout button (unlabeled) bottom-right.
press 350 790
wait 1200
# List mode renders the title/subtitle quotes; scroll with a slow drag (tilt) then back.
gesture pan 200 650 0 -350 600
wait 900
gesture pan 200 300 0 350 600
wait 900
# Fling down and toggle back to grid while the scroll is still decelerating.
gesture pan 200 700 0 -500 150
press 350 790
wait 1500
# Grid: scroll to the end and back to the top.
gesture pan 200 700 0 -550 300
wait 600
gesture pan 200 700 0 -550 300
wait 1200
# One upward scroll only: a downward drag that starts at offset 0 is taken by
# the app's drag-to-close gesture and would close the demo.
gesture pan 200 250 0 500 300
wait 1200
# Rapid toggles interrupt the 700ms LinearTransition several times.
press 350 790
wait 200
press 350 790
wait 200
press 350 790
wait 200
press 350 790
wait 200
press 350 790
wait 1500
# Ends in list mode; one more toggle back to grid.
press 350 790
wait 1500
wait "label=\"Close\"" 15000
press "role=\"button\" label=\"Close\""
wait 1500
